{"sections":[{"slug":"对偶复形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"对偶复形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">对偶复形</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“对偶复形”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>(Artan <span lang=\"zh\">讲的</span>)\n$f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部Noether概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部</span> Noether <span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Gorenstein态射","text":"Gorenstein <span lang=\"zh\">态射</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">局部有限型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">有限</span> Tor <span lang=\"zh\">维数</span>, $f^!(\\mathcal O_Y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">同构于</span> $\\mathcal D(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的某可逆层</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">记之为</span> $\\omega_{X/Y}$. <span lang=\"zh\">它满足</span>\n$$\r\nf^!(F)\\simeq Lf^*(F)\\otimes\\omega_{X/Y}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义函子</span> $f^{\\#}(G)\\colon \\mathcal D(Y)\\to\\mathcal D(X)$,\n$$\r\nf^{\\#}(G):= LF^*(G)\\otimes\\omega_{X/Y}[n].\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它满足</span>\n$$\r\nf^{\\#}(F\\otimes G)\\simeq f^{\\#}(F)\\otimes f^{\\#}(G),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">且对于光滑态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$, $g\\colon Y\\to Z$,\n$$\r\n(gf)^{\\#}\\simeq f^{\\#}g^{\\#}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}